  "• Wompi (Colombia) — procesamiento de pagos City Pass y Tasa Portuaria.": { en: "• Wompi (Colombia) — payment processing for City Pass and Port Tax.", fr: "• Wompi (Colombie) — traitement des paiements City Pass et Taxe Portuaire.", pt: "• Wompi (Colômbia) — processamento de pagamentos City Pass e Taxa Portuária." },
